flowchart TB
    N1["1. Entry domain: contract source | template config | toolchain settings"]
    N2["2. Normalization: shape contract intent into ABI, stack values, host calls, and PolkaVM input"]
    N3["3. Core mechanism: Build artifacts | Validate metadata | Package deployment files"]
    N4["4. State and commitment: ABI digest, execution result, gas report, and syscall trace"]
    N5["5. Evidence or result: contract package | manifest | developer diagnostics"]
    N6["6. Consumer boundary: RISC-V host | Neo N4 L2 node | developer tooling"]
    N7["7. Failure path: ABI decode fails, host callback rejects, gas is exhausted, or guest faults"]
    N8["8. Extension point: VM profiles, host syscalls, ABI codecs, and contract templates"]
    N1 --> N2
    N1 --> N3
    N1 --> N4
    N1 --> N5
    N1 --> N6
    N1 --> N7
    N1 --> N8
    N2 -. constrains .-> N4
    N4 -. produces .-> N5
    N5 -. consumed by .-> N6
    classDef core fill:#0f172a,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#e5f2ff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef support fill:#111827,stroke:#64748b,color:#f8fafc;
    class N1 core;
    class N2,N3,N4,N5,N6,N7,N8 support;
